2 CONT      Louis II de Longueville, Duc de Longueville was born in 1510 at Blandy, France. He married Marie de Guise, daughter of Claude de Lorraine, Duc de Guise and Antoinette de Bourbon, on 4 August 1534. ▼1 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1537. ▼1
2 CONT
2 CONT      Louis II de Longueville, Duc de Longueville gained the title of Duc de Longueville.
