2 CONC Orléans , wife of Duke Charles Emmanuel II Jean Gaston d'Orléans, Duke of Valois (1650-1652) Anne Marie d'Orléans, M lle de Chartres (1652-1656) Mary Porcher, he also had an illegitimate daughter:
