2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT On 16 July 1608, at the Château de Fontainebleau, he married Françoise de Lorraine, Duchesse de Mercoeur et de Penthièvre (d. 1669), the wealthy heiress of Philippe Emmanuel, Duke of Mercoeur. The couple had three children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis II, duc de Vendôme (1612–1669)
2 CONT
2 CONT François, duc de Beaufort (1616–1669)
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth, Mlle de Vendôme (Paris, August 1614 – Paris, 19 May 1664), married in Paris on 11 July 1643 Charles Amédée, Duc de Nemours.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fran%C3%A7oise_de_Lorraine_%281592%E2%80%931669%29
2 CONT
2 CONT Françoise de Lorraine (1592–1669)
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
