2 CONT  Henri II d'Orléans, Duc de Longueville was born in 1596. (1) He married Anne Genevieve de Bourbon-Condé, Duchesse de Longueville, daughter of Henri II de Bourbon-Condé, Prince de Condé and Charlotte de Montmorency, on 2 June 1642
2 CONC . (1) He died in 1663. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Henri II d'Orléans, Duc de Longueville gained the title of Duc de Longueville.
