1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Antoine II of Créquy ( Antoine de Blanchefort ) (° around 1545 † 1575 ), lord of Saint-Jeanvrin , bishop of Nantes ( 1562 - 1566 ), heir to his uncle the cardinal of Saint-Triphon on the condition of bearing the na
2 CONC me and the arms of the Créquy family , married on November 19, 1572 with Chrétienne d'Aguerre (1556-1611), including:
