2 CONT Charles de Blanchefort (or Charles I st Blanchefort Crequi or Charles Créquy Lesdiguières) (° 1571 - Canaples - 17 March 1638 - before Fort Bremen in Piedmont ), Prince de Poix , lord of Créquy of Fressin and of Canaples , 2 e Duk
2 CONC e Lesdiguières and peer of France ( 1626 ), Marquis de Vizille and Treffort , Count of Sault , BaronVienne-le-Chastel and La Tour-d'Aigues , Colonel of the French Guards and Marshal of France , Knight of the Holy Spirit (1619)
