2 NOTE by George Jamesone.
3 CONT Jamesone’s clientele encompassed the leading nobility of Scotland, and he was on unusually intimate terms with the Erskine family. As well as painting Lady Mary, he painted her first son William Keith, 5th Earl Marischal, and her 
3 CONC third son George Keith became godfather to Jamesone’s son.
