2 CONT * [S37] BP2003 volume 1, page 472. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Hon. Catherine Hamilton was born in 1623. She was the daughter of Claud Hamilton, 2nd Lord Hamilton, Baron of Strabane and Lady Jean Gordon. She married Owen Wynne circa 1655. She married John Bingham after 1655.She died in 1670/7
2 CONC 1. From circa 1655, her married name became Wynne. From after 1670, her married name became Bingham. Source: http://www.thepeerage.com/p11035.htm#i110348
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogy===
