1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Wikipedia Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>George Hamilton, 4th Lord Hamilton, Baron of Strabane</strong> (c. 1636/7 – 14 April 1668), an Irish peer, was the younger son of Claud Hamilton, 2nd Baron Hamilton of Strabane and Lady Jean Gordon.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Elizabeth Fagan and had three children:
2 CONT * Claud Hamilton, 4th Earl of Abercorn (1659–1691)
2 CONT * The Hon. Anne Hamilton (d. 1680), married John Browne, without issue
2 CONT * Charles Hamilton, 5th Earl of Abercorn (d. 1701)
2 CONT
2 CONT After the Restoration, he obtained the return of some of the family lands around Strabane, which had been confiscated in 1650."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: Wikipedia contributors, 'George Hamilton, 4th Baron Hamilton of Strabane', <em>Wikipedia, The Free Encyclopedia</em>, 17 March 2012, 18:25 UTC, <http://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=George_Hamilton,_4th_Baron_Hamilto
2 CONC n_of_Strabane&oldid=482407682> [accessed 30 December 2012]
