2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p2978.htm#i29777
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Mary Keith [1]
2 CONT *F, #29777, 
2 CONT *d. after 1683
2 CONT *Last Edited=19 Aug 2012
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.15%
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Mary Keith was the daughter of William Keith, 5th Earl Marischal and Lady Mary Erskine.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John Graham, Lord Graham of Kinpont, son of William Graham, 7th Earl of Menteith and Agnes Gray, circa 11 April 1632.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died after 1683.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became Graham.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Mary Keith and John Graham, Lord Graham of Kinpont
2 CONT *1. William Graham, 8th Earl of Menteith [3] b. c 1634, d. 12 Sep 1694
2 CONT *2. Mary Graham [3] b. b 1644, d. Dec 1720
2 CONT *3. Elizabeth Graham [3] b. b 1644
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT *1. [S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 2, page 2195. Hereinafter cited as Burke's 
2 CONC Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT *2. [S37] Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition, volume 2, page 2752.
2 CONT *3. [S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Exti
2 CONC nct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume I, page 76. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
