1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Charles Erskine [or Arskin], of Alva</strong>, 3d but 1st surv. 5. of the Hon. Sir Charles Erskine, of Alva and Cambus Kenneth, by Mary, da. of Sir Thomas Hope, 1st Baronet [S. 1628], of Craighall, which Charles was a yr.
2 CONC  s. of John, Earl of Mar [S.], by his 2d wife, Mary, da. of Esme (Stewart), Duke of Lennox .[S.], was b.  4 July 1643 ; suc. his father, 8 July 1663, being served his heir 15 July 1665, and was cr. a Baronet [S.], as above, 30 Apr
2 CONC il 1666, with rem. to the heirs male of his body. He was M.P. [S.] for Clackmannanshire, 1665 and  1667, and for Stirlingshire, 1689 till death in 1690. He m., about 1670, Christian, da. of Sir James Dundas, of Arnistoun. He d. 4 
2 CONC June 1690."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524408#page/n269/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1904; Vol. IV; page 250-251
2 CONT
