2 CONC nct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume III, page 267. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT     [S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume III, page 310.
2 CONT     [S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 1, page 1034. Hereinafter cited as Burke's 
2 CONC Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
