2 CONC ster of Sasines for the Sheriffdom of Lanark, reference RS42/VIII/119]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''2 June 1699 x 5 July 1709: William, Duke of Hamilton, formerly Earl of Selkirk. Janet Douglas, natural daughter of William, Duke of Hamilton. Gavin Muirhead of Lauchope, son of Sir James Muirhead of Lauchope. [Particular Regist
2 CONC er of Sasines for the Sheriffdom of Lanark, reference RS42/XI/301]'''
