2 CONT It is reported that when the Act of Union was signed in 1707, the disruption from either the festivities or the riots resulted in his escape. Drumlanrig, then around 10 years old, slaughtered a servant in the house's kitchen, roas
2 CONC ting him alive on a spit, and began to eat him before he was discovered and apprehended.[1][2][3] He was afterwards known as 'The Cannibalistic Idiot'. The oven that he used can be seen in a room in the basement of Queensberry Hou
2 CONC se, which housed the Parliament's Allowances Office until 2012, when it became a private bar for MSPs and their guests. 
