1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == WILLIAM, LORD KEITH ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''William, Lord Keith, is the son of https://www.geni.com/people/William-Keith-Earl-Marischal/6000000013944590743?through=6000000185338175992 and his second wife https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Seton/6000000013944664705?thr
2 CONC ough=6000000185338175992 [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun06pauluoft/page/60/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VI: 60]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''William, Lord Keith, is reported to have been born on 11 August 1638. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun06pauluoft/page/60/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VI: 60] His baptism was registered at Tranent in East Lothian, Sco
2 CONC tland. [National Records of Scotland, Tranent Baptisms, reference OPR.722/1]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
