1 NAME Stanley /Howard/
2 GIVN Stanley
2 SURN Howard
2 _MARNM Howard
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 8 FEB 1677
2 ADDR
3 CITY Hitchin
3 STAE Hertfordshire
3 CTRY UK
1 DEAT
2 DATE 8 FEB 1735
