2 CONC e, 16th of Kilravock, Sheriff of Ross (a 1746) 	(2)	Margaret Rose (d c1703) 	m. (04.02.1701) Sir John Mackenzie, 3rd Bart of Coul	(3)	Mary Rose	m. (21.10.1708) Duncan Forbes, 5th of Culloden (b 10.11.1685, d 10.12.1747, Lord Presi
2 CONC dent of Court of Session)
