1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>James, Lord Doune</strong>, who died v.p. 1685, having married (contract 26 December 1677) Catharine, daughter of Elizabeth, Countess of Dysart in her own right (who ultimately married the Duke of Lauderdale) by her first
2 CONC  husband, Sir Lionel Tollemache, Bart. She was married, secondly, after 1690, as his second wife, to John, fifteenth Earl of Sutherland, and died about 1705."
2 CONT
