1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lady Ann Gordon was baptised on 18 July 1675 at Methlick, Aberdeenshire, Scotland. She was the daughter of George Gordon of Haddo, 1st Earl of Aberdeen and Anne Lockhart.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Alexander Montgomerie, 9th Earl of Eglinton, son of Alexander Montgomerie, 8th Earl of Eglinton and Lady Elizabeth Crichton. She died in December 1708 at age 33. She was buried on 10 December 1708.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Lady Ann Gordon and Alexander Montgomerie, 9th Earl of Eglinton
2 CONT # Lady Mary Montgomerie+1 b. 29 Nov 1704, d. Jun 1777
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
