2 CONT '''Lady Margaret Leslie. here treated, is the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Patrick-Leslie-Fifteenth-Baron-of-Balquhain/6000000007377870316?through=6000000007550144314  [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatal
2 CONC ogue/details.aspx?reference=GD23%2f10%2f527&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=george+leslie&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1700&dt=1750&di=n NRS: GD23/10/527]'''
2 CONT
