1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Mary Hay, 14th Countess of Erroll (died 19 August 1758) was a Scottish noblewoman and suo jure Countess of Erroll. As 18th Hereditary Lord High Constable and Knight Marischal of Scotland, she was the Senior Great Officer among the
2 CONC  Royal Officers of Scotland and Chief of the King's Household in Scotland. She inherited these titles in 1717 on the death of her unmarried brother, Charles Hay, 13th Earl of Erroll.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mary_Hay,_14th_Countess_of_Erroll
