2 CONT Antonina Czartoryska; Konstancja Czartoryska; Aleksandra Czartoryska; Noble family	Czartoryski; Father	Kazimierz Czartoryski; Mother	Izabela Elżbieta Morsztyn; Born	April 26, 1696; Klewań, Poland; Died	August 13, 1775 (aged 79); W
2 CONC arsaw, Poland;
2 CONT
2 CONT Prince Michał Fryderyk Czartoryski (1696-1775) was a Polish nobleman, Duke of Klewań and Żuków, magnate, Knight of the Order of the White Eagle since 1726. Co-founder and leader of the "Familia".
2 CONT
2 CONT He was Steward of Lithuania since 1720, Castellan of Wilno since 1722, Grand Chancellor of Lithuania since 1752, Starost grodzki, łucki, uświacki, jurbolski, homelski, kupiski and pieniański.
2 CONT
