1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JOHN MURRAY===
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>MURRAY, John (d.1753), of Philiphaugh</strong>, Selkirk - 1st s. of Sir James Murray, M.P. [S], of Philiphaugh, Lord Philiphaugh, S.C.J., and ld. clerk register [S], by his 2nd w. Margaret, da. of Sir Alexander Don, 1st B
2 CONC t., of Newton, Berwick. m. 31 Dec. 1711, Eleanor, 1st da. of Lord Basil Hamilton (6th s. of William, 3rd Duke of Hamilton [S]), 4s. 2da.; bro.-in-law of John Pringle. suc. fa. 1708...
2 CONT
2 CONT ...He died 2 July 1753."
2 CONT
