2 CONT **	A.	John Lindsay, 19th Earl of Crawford, 3rd Earl of Lindsay (d 12.1713, Lt. General) 	m. Amelia Stewart (d 18.02.1711, dau of James Stewart, Lord Doune)
2 CONT *** 	i.	John Lindsay, 20th Earl of Crawford, 4th Earl of Lindsay (b 04.10.1702, dsp 24.12.1749, Lt. General)	m. (03.04.1747) Jean Murray (d 10.10.1747, dau of James Murray, 2nd Duke of Atholl) 	(d.s.p.) John was succeeded by his k
2 CONC insman George Lindsay-Crawford below.  “He [19th Earl] was succeeded by his oldest surviving son, John Lindsay, his first-born son, William, having died.”  See [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Lindsay,_19th_Earl_of_Crawford Wik
2 CONC ipedia - John Lindsay, 19th Earl of Crawford and 3rd Earl of Lindsay (died December 1713)]
2 CONT *** 	ii.	William Lindsay (bpt 03.04.1705, dsp before 01.05.1755, Captain)
2 CONT ***iii.	Catherine Lindsay (dsp 28.02.1768)	m. John Wemyss (d 01.1786, Lieutenant Governor of Edinburgh Castle)
2 CONT ***	iv.	Mary Lindsay (bpt 24.19.1706) 	m. Dugald Campbell of Glensadell
