2 CONT Lord Anne Douglas-Hamilton was married to Anna Powell and had two sons, Lt. Col.James Douglas-Hamilton (1746–1804) and Admiral Charles Powell Douglas-Hamilton (1747–1825).  However, in 1734 he had already had an illegitimate son b
2 CONC y Mary Edwardes, named Gerard Anne Edwardes.  Gerard went on to marry Lady Jane Noel.
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lord_Anne_Douglas-Hamilton]
2 CONT
2 CONT Lord Anne's unusual surname was after his godmother, Queen Anne.
