2 CONT Added note provided in discussion by Doug Fenske: From Robert Erskine.....
2 CONT Captain Thomas' father is Thomas S (Aspy) Erskine, born 5 Jun 1691 in Scotland, died 11 Jun 1755 in Hamilton Twp, Cumberland, PA. Married Ellernor Stephenson 1726 in Scotland - children: James, Captain Thomas, Jean Mary, Elizabeth
2 CONC . Married Rachel Liberton 15 Jun 1721 in Scotland - children: Katharine, Janet, Hendry, John, Rachel.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lowland Scottish ancestry - Co. Fife, Scotland. Immigrated to America from Co. Antrim, Ireland 1738-9. Will signed by mark: Thomas Aspy. Presbyterian. Land warrant , 100 acres Cumberland Co, PA, surveyed 26 Feb 1750. Fled Scotland
2 CONC  after 1st Jacobite Rebellion of 1714 and went to Ireland. Possibly came into U.S. through the port of Philadelphia, PA. Possible brother (?) Alexander Askey settled in Shippensburg, Cumberland Co, PA Jun 1730. Could of have gone 
2 CONC by surname of Askey, Erskine, or any associated surname.
