1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir Henry Stirling, Baronet [S. 1666], of Ardoch</strong>, s. and. h. by 1st wife, b. 18 Nov. 1688 ; suc. to the Baronetcy, in Feb. 1702 ; admitted as Advocate, 29 Nov. 1710. He m. 31 Dec. 1726, Anna, da. of Thomas Gordon
