1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Venerable Anthony Hamilton
2 CONT * b. 5 May 1739, d. 4 October 1812
2 CONT
2 CONT Venerable Anthony Hamilton was born on 5 May 1739.2 He was the son of Alexander Hamilton and Barbara Lilley. He married Anne Terrick, daughter of Rt. Rev. Richard Terrick, on 12 February 1767. He died on 4 October 1812 at age 73.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the Rector at Hadham, Hertfordshire, England. He graduated with a Doctor of Divinity (D.D.). He held the office of Archdeacon of Colchester. He was the Vicar at St. Martin-in-the-Fields, Covent Garden, London, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Venerable Anthony Hamilton and Anne Terrick
2 CONT
2 CONT * Charlotte Hamilton b. 2 Dec 1767
2 CONT * William Richard Hamilton b. 9 Jan 1777, d. 11 Jul 1859
2 CONT * Terrick Hamilton b. 12 Jul 1778
