2 CONT Louis, Dauphin of France (1729–1765)
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT   (Redirected from Louis, Dauphin of France (1729-1765))
2 CONT
2 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis-Ferdinand
2 CONT
2 CONT Dauphin of Viennois
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis-Ferdinand, Dauphin of France
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse 	Infanta Maria Teresa of Spain
2 CONT
2 CONT Duchess Marie-Josèphe of Saxony
2 CONT
