2 CONT One of Haydn's and Beethoven's pastrons. He was dedicatee of some of these composers' greatest works, including Haydn's "Lobkowitz" quartests (Opus 77). and Beethoven's 3rd, 5th and 6th symphonies and his opus 18th string quartets
