1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT "William Kerr, 3rd Marquess of Lothian KT (c. 1690 – 28 July 1767) was a Scottish nobleman, styled Master of Jedburgh from 1692 to 1703 and Lord Jedburgh from 1703 to 1722. He was the son of William Kerr, 2nd Marquess of Lothian a
2 CONC nd Lady Jean Campbell."
2 CONT
