1 NAME Joseph /Douglass/ Jr.
2 GIVN Joseph
2 SURN Douglass
2 NSFX Jr.
2 _MARNM Douglass
2 NICK Douglas
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 25 DEC 1747
