2 CONC n, James, tenth Earl of Derby, he succeeded in right of his grandmother (see No. 101) to the sovereignty of the Isle of Man and to the English Barony of Strange, created 1628. He married, first, 28th April 1726, Jane, daughter of 
2 CONC Thomas Frederick, who died 13th June 1748, having had:
