2 CONC harlotte Ermgardana Van Ittersum” (1785) < [https://francearchives.gouv.fr/en/facomponent/f3af98048328e981f02a0e93ea730fc5149fdf12 link] > 
2 CONT # Alston, David.  “Emet Ullah (c. 1725? - 1820) and the Earl Marischal of Scotland” (Draft May 2020).  < [https://www.davidalston.info/documents/paintings-and-portraits/emet-ullah-and-the-earl-marischal-of-scotland-v1.pdf PDF] > 
