2 CONC ttishfriendof02cuthuoft/page/n9/mode/2up>
2 CONT ## James Boswell (ed. Frederick A Pottle), Boswell in Holland and Boswell On The Grand Tour Germany And Switzerland 1764 (London, 1928) online at <https://archive.org/details/boswellinholland027081mbp/page/n5/mode/2up> and <https:
2 CONC //archive.org/details/in.ernet.dli.2015.75046/page/n5/mode/2up>
2 CONT ## Correspondence of George Keith, Jean-Jacques Rousseau, and Adam Ferguson online in Electronic Enlightenment at <http://www.e-enlightenment.com.nls.idm.oclc.org/index.html>
2 CONT ## Nancy Mitford, Frederick the Great (London, 1970)
2 CONT ##Rebecca Wills, The Jacobites and Russia 1715–1750 (Tuckwell Press, 2002)
