1 NAME Sir William Forbes, 5th Bart. of Monymusk
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1707
1 DEAT
2 DATE 12 MAY 1743
1 OCCU 5 .Baronet
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir William Forbes, Baronet [S 1626] of Edinburgh</strong>, grandson and heir, being 1st son and heir of John Forbes, by Mary [whose issue, in 1781, became heir of line] of Alexander (Forbes), 3rd Lord Forbes of Pitsligo.
2 CONC  He was Advocate [S], 6 January 1728. He married in 1730, Christian, daughter of John Forbes of Boyndlie, by his 1st wife, Susan, daughter of George Morison, of Bognie, which John was a younger son, by the 2nd wife of the 3rd Baro
2 CONC net. He died 12 May 1743. His widow died 1789."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524382#page/n323/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1900; Vol. II; page 305
