1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://www.thepeerage.com/p2314.htm#i23132]
2 CONT
2 CONT John Rawdon, 1st Earl of Moira was born on 17 March 1719/20. He was the son of Sir John Rawdon, 3rd Bt. and Dorothy Levinge. He married, firstly, Lady Helena Perceval, daughter of John Perceval, 1st Earl of Egmont and Catherine Pa
2 CONC rker, on 10 November 1741.2 He married, secondly, Hon. Anne Hill, daughter of Trevor Hill, 1st Viscount Hillsborough and Mary Rowe, on 23 December 1746.3 He married, thirdly, Elizabeth Hastings, Baroness Hastings, daughter of Theo
2 CONC philus Hastings, 9th Earl of Huntingdon and Lady Selina Shirley, on 26 February 1752.4 He died on 20 June 1793 at age 73 at Dublin, County Dublin, Ireland.4
2 CONT
2 CONT John Rawdon, 1st Earl of Moira was created 1st Earl of Moira [Ireland].
2 CONT
