2 CONT
2 CONT 2.Lady Charlotte Adelaide Constantia Rawdon d. 18346
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.Lady Anne Elizabeth Rawdon b. 16 May 1753, d. 8 Jan 18131
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.Francis Rawdon-Hastings, 1st Marquess of Hastings+ b. 9 Dec 1754, d. 28 Nov 18264
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.Hon. John Theophilus Rawdon+ b. 19 Nov 1756, d. 5 May 1808
2 CONT
