2 CONC ilus [Hastings], 9th Earl of Huntingdon, by his wife Lady Selina Shirley, 2nd dau. of Washington [Shirley], 2nd Earl Ferrers, by his wife Mary Levinge, 1st dau. by his first wife of Rt Hon Sir Richard Levinge, 1st Bt. MP, of Parwi
