2 CONT
2 CONT 1a.Elizabeth Anne Rawdon (d. 10 Aug 1874), mar. 21 Jun 1817 Maj Gen Lord George William Russell GCB MP (b. 8 May 1790; d. 16 Jul 1846), 2nd son by his first wife of John [Russell], 6th Duke of Bedford, and had issue
2 CONT
