2 CONT
2 CONT '''Amos A. Hix'''
2 CONT
2 CONT AMOS4 HIX (Nathaniel3, John2, Robert?1) was born in Henry County, VA 1710. This researcher is unsure of this date and place. Amos died 1786 in Mecklenburg County, VA. He made his will in 1785 in Mecklenburg County, naming his chil
2 CONC dren and his grandson Sherwood Bugg.
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://files.usgwarchives.net/va/mecklenburg/wills/ahix.txt Amos Hix's Last Will & Testament] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Amos HIX and Mary Frances BUGG had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. DANIEL 5 was born in Lunenburg County, VA Oct 8, 1761. Daniel died Jan 13, 1822 in Clark County, GA, at 60 years of age. He married SUSANNAH JEFFRIES in Mecklenburg County, VA, Apr 12, 1784. Susannah was born ca 1765. She was t
2 CONC he daughter of '''Swepson JEFFRIES''' and Sarah HIX. She married MILES T. CROWDER in Mecklenburg County, VA, Nov 5, 1806. Either Daniel Hix's death date is wrong, this marriage date is wrong, or the first marriage ended in divorce
2 CONC . Needs more research.
2 CONT ii. SHERWOOD was born in Lunenburg County, VA, ca 1762. Sherwood died 1814 in Henderson County, KY. He married SARAH ANN GORDON in Mecklenburg County, VA, Jan 18, 1782.
2 CONT iii. MARTHA was born in Lunenburg County, VA. ca 1763. Martha died in Mecklenburg County. She married DABNEY PHILLIPS. Dabney was born in Mecklenburg County, VA ca 1760. Dabney died Sep 8, 1806 in Mecklenburg County, VA.
2 CONT iv. JOHN was born ca 1764.
2 CONT v. ELIZABETH was born in Mecklenburg County, VA, ca 1770. She married JAMES HESTER. James was born ca 1770.
2 CONT vi. JAMES was born in Mecklenburg County, VA, ca 1770.
2 CONT vii. LUCY was born in Mecklenburg County, VA, ca 1770. She married twice. She married WILLIAM BUGG. William died bef 1785. She married UNK PERDIEU bef 1785.
2 CONT viii. MARY was born in Mecklenburg County, VA, ca 1770. She married WILLIAM W. JOHNSON ca 1785. William was born ca 1760. He was the son of Phillip JOHNSON. William died 1803 in Mecklenburg County, VA. William served in the milita
2 CONC ry in Mecklenburg County, VA, before 1782. He made a claim in Mecklenburg for 275 pounds of beef to the Rev Army. Lived at Buckhorn Creek in Mecklenburg County
2 CONT ix. NATHANIEL was born in Mecklenburg County, VA ca 1770. He married RUTH BUGG. She was the daughter of Samuel BUGG and Sarah BACON.
2 CONT x. SARAH was born in Mecklenburg County, VA, ca 1770. She married '''Swepson JEFFRIES, Sr.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT http://freepages.rootsweb.com/~coxcuz/genealogy/Ancestry%20Files/FAMILY%20JOURNAL%20HIX.pdf
