1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Margaret Hamilton was born on 1707 in Canobie, Dumfries (now Dumfries & Galloway), Southern Uplands, Scotland.  Margaret married William Denus Armstrong on c. 1727 in County Fermanagh, Ireland (County Fermanagh and
2 CONC  South Tyrone, Northern Ireland) and had a child:  Samuel Armstrong.  She passed away in Abbeville District, South Carolina.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Hamilton Armstrong arrived in South Carolina, United States on December 1767 from Ballimena, County Antrim, Ireland aboard the ship "Earl of Denegal."  The ship's captain was Duncan Ferguson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Hamilton Armstrong is my 7th great grandmother.
