1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir John Inglis, Baronet [S 1687] of Cramond</strong>, brother and heir, born probably about 1716; was sometime a merchant and Dep. Barrack Master for Scotland; succeeded to the Baronetcy, 9 November 1772, and devoted him
2 CONC self much to the improvement of his estate. He married in or before 1760, Christian, daughter of Sir Robert Sinclair, 3rd Baronet [S 1664] of Longformacus, by Christian, daughter of Adam Cockburn, Lord Justice-Clerk. She died 15 J
2 CONC uly 1790, at Cramond. He died s.p.m.s. 5 April 1799."
2 CONT
