2 CONT The Life Summary of Thomas Erskine
2 CONT When Thomas Erskine Askey was born on 25 July 1727, in County Antrim, Ireland, his father, Hon. Thomas Erskine, was 36 and his mother, Ellenor Stephenson, was 33. He married Elizabeth "Betsy" Baker on 12 June 1764, in Carlisle, Cu
2 CONC mberland, Pennsylvania, United States. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 4 daughters. He died on 24 November 1807, in Howard Township, Centre, Pennsylvania, United States, at the age of 80, and was buried in Jacksonvill
2 CONC e, Marion Township, Centre, Pennsylvania, United States.
2 CONT
