2 CONT On Tuesday last at Walcot, near Bath after a long and painful illness, the Right Hon. Henry David Erskine, Earl of Buchan, Lord Auchterhouse, Cardross, and Glendovechy. His Lordship, in the year 1739, married Miss Agnes Stuart, se
2 CONC cond daughter of Sir James Stuart, Bart of Coltness; by whom he had nine children, five of whom survive.. him. His corpse arrived at Edinburgh on Sunday the 20th and was privately interred on Monday thereafter in the royal chapel 
2 CONC of Holyroodhouse. ref: The Scots Magazine Dec 1767 & Derby Mercury - 11 Dec 1767 pg2 Contributed by GariochGraver
