1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir William Stirling, Baronet [S. 1666], of Ardoch</strong>, 1st s. and h., b. in Russia about 1730 ; was a Lieut, in Gen. Halket's regiment in the Dutch service; suc. to the Baronetcy 24 Nov 1753. He m. 17 April 1763, Ch
2 CONC ristian, da. of John Erskine, of Carnock Advocate She d. 7 Sep. 1788. He d. s.p.m.(») 26 July 1799. Admon. Dec. 1801."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524408#page/n273/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1904; Vol. IV; page 254
2 CONT
2 CONT == Other References ==
2 CONT * [http://archive.org/stream/sterlinggeneal01ster#page/122/mode/2up The Sterling genealogy]; by Albert Mack Sterling;1909; page 122
