2 CONT '''From [http://www.thepeerage.com/p41498.htm#i414974 thepeerage - John Erskine]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT John Erskine was born on Saturday, 30 December 1758. He was the son of James Erskine, Lord Alva and [ERROR Jean Stirling]. He married Christian Carruthers, daughter of John Carruthers, on Wednesday, 23 August 1786. He died on Wedn
2 CONC esday, 16 January 1793 at age 34. He was a practising barrister. He was Clerk of the Commissary Court.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of John Erskine and Christian Carruthers
