2 CONT
2 CONT Married firstly (19 September 1749) Margaret Macguire (died 1766, daughter of Hugh Macguire of Drumdow) Married secondly Jean Stirling (daughter of John Stirling) Uncertain who was the mother of which child.
2 CONT
2 CONT # John Erskine (born Saturday, 30 December 1758, died Wednesday, 16 January 1793) who married (Wednesday, 23 August 1786) Christian Carruthers (daughter of John Carruthers) and had issue
2 CONT # Isabella Erskine, who married Lieutenant Colonel Patrick Tytler (of Woodhouselee family)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''From [http://www.advocates.org.uk/faculty-of-advocates/the-advocates-library/alva-collection Alva Collection | Faculty of Advocates]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT [Charles Areskine of Alva, Lord Tinwald] Charles’s son James Erskine passed the collections to his son, John Erskine, also an advocate, who subsequently passed them down to his son James Erskine of Aberdona, who was a trustee of t
2 CONC he Dollar Institution from 1826 and may have donated a part of his grandfather’s collection to Dollar Academy (as it became), with other parts of the collection being dispersed globally.
