1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ===JAMES CAMPBELL, EARL OF LOUDEN (formerly JAMES MURE CAMPBELL OF ROWALLAN)===
2 CONT
2 CONT Maj.-Gen. James Campbell, 5th Earl of Loudoun was born on 11 February 1726. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Sir James Campbell and Lady Jane Boyle. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Flora Macleod, daughter of John Macleod, on 30 April 1777. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 28 April 1786 at age 60.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Maj.-Gen. James Campbell, 5th Earl of Loudoun gained the title of 5th Earl of Loudoun.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Maj.-Gen. James Campbell, 5th Earl of Loudoun and Flora Macleod
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.Flora Campbell+ b. Aug 1780, d. 8 Jan 1840
2 CONT
