1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lady Grace Montgomerie was born circa 1689.2 She was the daughter of Alexander Montgomerie, 9th Earl of Eglinton and Margaret Cochrane.1 She married Robert Dalzell, 5th Earl of Carnwath, son of Sir John Dalzell, 2n
2 CONC d Bt. and Harriet Murray, circa 19 January 1710.1 She died in January 1713, without male issue.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Grace Montgomerie and Robert Dalzell, 5th Earl of Carnwath
2 CONT # Lady Margaret Dalzell3 d. 18 Apr 1781
2 CONT # Lady Euphemia Dalzell3 b. 12 Feb 1703
2 CONT
