1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT William Turk, born 1744 in Ireland; came with his parents James and Mary Turk to America, and settled, 1757, in South Carolina. Served in the Revolutionary War in General Pickens Staff of South Carolina as his Express Bearer or Co
2 CONC urier. William married 3 March 1784, Margaret Archibald of North Carolina. They had four children. He died April 10, 1795 in Franklin County, Georgia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT # John Turk
2 CONT # Mary Hall Hamilton (born Turk)
2 CONT # James Turk
2 CONT # Major William Turk
