1 NOTE After the end of the French Revolution, and the reign of the Bonaparte Family of France, Louis XVIII, brother of Louis XVIII became the King of France in 1814.  His reign ended in 1830.  He was succeeded by his brother, Charles X.
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis XVI, grandson of King Louis XV, came to the throne of France in 1774.  His eighteen year reign ended at the guillotine in 1792.  His son, Louis XVII later regained the throne in 1793 to 1795.
