2 CONC ation 	28 May 1825 (aged 67) Predecessor 	Louis XVIII Successor 	Louis-Philippe I as King of the French Spouse 	Princess Maria Teresa of Savoy Issue Louis Antoine, Duke of Angoulême Charles Ferdinand, Duke of Berry Father 	Louis-F
