1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''John Hooke Campbell-Hooke'''
2 CONT
2 CONT [From http://www.thepeerage.com/p3642.htm#i36417 The Peerage]
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #36417
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=14 Apr 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT      John Hooke Campbell-Hooke was the son of John Campbell of Cawdor and Mary Pryse.1 He married Eustacia Basset, daughter of Francis Basset.2
2 CONT      He lived at Bangeston, Pembrokeshire, Wales. His name was legally changed to John Hooke Campbell-Hooke.2 He was given the name of John Hooke Campbell at birth.2 He held the office of Lord Lyon King of Arms in 1754.2 He also h
2 CONC ad a son and two other daughters.2
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John Hooke Campbell-Hooke and Eustacia Basset 1.Eustacia Campbell1 2.Charlotte Campbell1 d. 1849
2 CONT
