2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''John Campbell''' was born in 1740 in Amherst, Amherst County, VA, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-108591379 Henry Campbell] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-108591392 Charity Campbell (Catlet)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married [https://www.geni.com/profile-54773080 Anna Mayhew Campbell]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34686539518 Aaron Campbell, Sr]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34769250649 Robert David Campbell]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34769250651 Alcy Campbell]; 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1807 in Franklin, Georgia, USA, and was buried in Saint Mary's Cemetery, Camden County, Georgia, United States of America. 
