2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Joel Campbell''' was born in 1745 in Amherst, Amherst, Virginia, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-108591379 Henry Campbell] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-108591392 Charity Campbell]. 
