1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Rachel Catlet Higgenbotham (Campbell)''' was born in 1755 in Amherst, Virginia, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-108591379 Henry Campbell] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-108591392 Charity Campbell (Catlet)
2 CONC ]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Rachel married [https://www.geni.com/profile-14933992 Colonel James A. Higginbotham] on May 30, 1779, in Amherst, Virginia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-40160912 James Higginbotham]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-40160915 Judith Higginbotham]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-119593076 George Washington Higginbotham, Sr.]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-40160911 Col. Joseph Cabell Higginbotham, Sr.]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on March 28, 1809, in Amherst, Virginia, USA, and was buried in Higginbotham Family Cemetery, Amherst, Amherst, Virginia, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''References'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Rachel's Lineage'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''My Virginia Kin'''- Explains lineage to James and Rachel Higgenbotham, then to Rachel's parents; [https://www.geni.com/profile-108591379 Henry Campbell] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-108591392 Charity Campbell (Catlet)]. 
2 CONT
