1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''William Dunbar, Baronet, of Hempriggs'''
2 CONT
2 CONT From the three sources below it would seem that the following is the best summary-
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir William Dunbar, Baronet, of Hemriggs was the son of  James Dunbar, Baronet of Hempriggs.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1st Marriage''' 6 January 1729 to Elizabeth, only daughter and heiress of Alexander Dunbar of Westfield. She died 3 June 1746, with issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Kenneth, born 14 October 1729.
2 CONT * James, born 12 November 1730, died young.
2 CONT * Elizabeth, born 3 April 1732.
2 CONT * Margaret, born 26 July 1733.
2 CONT * Grizel, born 1 February 1735.
2 CONT * Christian, born 18 May 1736.
2 CONT * Janet, the only surviving child of first marriage, and heiress of Westfield; married, 26 February 1762, to Thomas Dunbar of Grangehill, who took the designation of Westfield. She died 16 September 1769, aged twenty-seven, and ha
2 CONC d issue
2 CONT
2 CONT '''2nd Marriage''' 21 March 1747, Jean, daughter of David Sinclair of Southdun. She died 9 August 1749 s.p. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * No issue
2 CONT
2 CONT '''3rd Marriage''' 21 October 1749, Henrietta, daughter of Hugh Rose of Kilravock. She died September 1795; issue two sons and three daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Sir Benjamin Sutherland Dunbar, - sixth Lord Duffus.
2 CONT * Robert Sutherland Dunbar.
2 CONT * Elizabeth. - died unmarried
2 CONT * Alexandrina.
2 CONT * Williamina
2 CONT
2 CONT William died on 12 June 1793.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------
2 CONT
2 CONT William Dunbar, Baronet, of Hempriggs (son of James Dunbar, Baronet, of Hempriggs) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir William Dunbar, Baronet, of Hempriggs, who succeeded. He married, first, 6 January 1729, Elizabeth, only daughter and heiress of Alexander Dunbar of Westfield. She died 3 June 1746, with issue. Secondly, 21 March 1747, Jean, d
2 CONC aughter of David Sinclair of Southdun. She died 9 August 1749 s.p. And thirdly, 21 October 1749, Henrietta, daughter of Hugh Rose of Kilravock. She died September 1795; issue two sons and three daughters. He died in 1792, leaving 
2 CONC issue:--
2 CONT *1. Kenneth, born 14 October 1729.
2 CONT *2. James, born 12 November 1730, died young.
2 CONT *3. Sir Benjamin Sutherland Dunbar, of whom hereafter as sixth Lord Duffus.
2 CONT *4. Robert Sutherland Dunbar.
2 CONT *5. Elizabeth, born 3 April 1732.
2 CONT *6. Margaret, born 26 July 1733.
2 CONT *7. Grizel, born 1 February 1735.
2 CONT *8. Christian, born 18 May 1736.
2 CONT *9. Janet, the only surviving child of first marriage, and heiress of Westfield; married, 26 February 1762, to Thomas Dunbar of Grangehill, who took the designation of Westfield. She died 16 September 1769, aged twenty-seven, and 
2 CONC had issue. (Janet Dunbar (Dunbar) (of Westfield)+ d. 16 Sep 1769)
2 CONT *10. Elizabeth.
2 CONT *11. Alexandrina.
2 CONT * 12. Williamina.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources: Balfour Paul, J. (1906) The Scots Peerage, vol. 3. Edinburgh: David Douglas.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://sites.google.com/site/fivegateways/alphabetical-index-s/sutherland/suth0061
2 CONT
2 CONT --------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p23350.htm#i233500
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir William Dunbar 2nd Baronet of Hempriggs was born before 1710. He was the son of James Sutherland-Dunbar Bart of Hempriggs and Elizabeth Dunbar.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir William Dunbar 2nd Baronet of Hempriggs married Elizabeth Dunbar, daughter of Alexander Dunbar, on 6 January 1728/29 at Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir William Dunbar 2nd Baronet of Hempriggs married secondly Jane Sinclair on 21 March 1747.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir William Dunbar 2nd Baronet of Hempriggs married Henrietta Rose on 21 October 1749. She was the second daughter of Hugh Rose of Kilravock.
2 CONT
2 CONT William died on 12 June 1793.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Sir William Dunbar 2nd Baronet of Hempriggs and Elizabeth Dunbar
2 CONT
2 CONT *Janet Dunbar (Dunbar) (of Westfield)+ d. 16 Sep 1769
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sir William Dunbar 2nd Baronet of Hempriggs and Henrietta Rose
2 CONT
2 CONT *Elizabeth Dunbar
2 CONT *Sir Benjamin Sutherland Dunbar 3rd Bart of Hempriggs b. 28 Apr 1761
2 CONT
2 CONT ------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www26.us.archive.org/stream/heraldryofmurray00john#page/10/mode/2up Page 10 No. 58
2 CONT
2 CONT (58) Sir William Dunbar, second Baronet of Hempriggs, died 1792. He was served heir to his brother, James, 22nd April 1760. He married, first, 6th January 1729, Elizabeth, daughter and heiress of Alexander Dunbar of Westfield, who
2 CONC  died 3rd June 1746. He married, second, 2 1st March 1747, Jean, daughter of David Sinclair of Southdun, who died s.p. 9th August 1749. He married, third, 21st October 1749, Henrietta, daughter of Hugh Rose of Kilravock, who died 
2 CONC September 1795. By his first wife he had:
2 CONT
2 CONT * 58(a) Kenneth Dunbar, born 14th October 1729.
2 CONT * 58(b) James Dunbar, born 12th November 1730 ; died young.
