2 CONT *Hogg, Bruce; [http://www.freemasonry.london.museum/os/wp-content/resources/frs_freemasons_complete_jan2012.pdf Freemasons and the Royal Society ed 2]; Library and Museum of Freemasonry; January 2012; page 39
