2 CONT Biography
2 CONT Hon. Isabella Erskine was the daughter of Henry David Erskine, 10th Earl of Buchan and Agnes Steuart.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married: 1. William Leslie Hamilton Esq on 22 January 1770 in Speldhurst, Kent, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Rev John Cuninghame on 5 April 1785, son of Maj. Gen. William Cuninghame, 13th Earl of Glencairn and Elizabeth Maguire in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Isabella died in 1824 without issue in Boulogne-Sur-Mer, France.
