2 CONC sting place	St. James's Chapel, London, England Military service Allegiance	United Kingdom Service/branch	British Army Rank	General Commands	General Officer Commanding, Ceylon Madras Army Battles/wars	 American Revolutionary War S
2 CONC econd Anglo-Mysore War Third Anglo-Mysore War Fourth Anglo-Mysore War Second Anglo-Maratha War
