2 CONT 2a George (Rt Rev); (105d) born 30 Jan 1761; Bp St David's; married 18 Dec 1780 '''Anne Charlotte (died 27 April 1844), Lady-in-Waiting to QUEEN CHARLOTTE''', daughter of Lt-Gen Francis Grant, MP (see STRATHSPEY, B), and died 1803
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.geni.com/people/Queen-Consort-Charlotte-of-Great-Britain/6000000003891728922 Queen Charlotte] - http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Descendants_of_George_III_and_Queen_Charlotte
2 CONT
2 CONT >{{//photos.geni.com/p13/6d/d3/eb/f9/5344483a21ef72fc/queen_charlotte_t.jpg}}
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p2217.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Anne Charlotte Grant'''1
2 CONT F, #22166, b. 9 August 1765, d. 27 April 1844
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Charlotte Grant was born on 9 August 1765 at Forres, Morayshire, Scotland.2 She was the daughter of Lt.-Gen. Francis Grant and Catherine Sophia Cox.1,2 She married Rt. Rev. Lord George Murray, son of Sir John Murray, 3rd Duke
2 CONC  of Atholl and Lady Charlotte Murray, Baroness Strange, on 18 December 1780.3 She died on 27 April 1844 at age 78.3
2 CONT
2 CONT She held the office of Lady-in-Waiting to Queen Charlotte.3
2 CONT
