1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Major Charles Thomas Grant of Grant was born in 1770 at Wokingham, Berkshire, England.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Lt.-Gen. Francis Grant and Catherine Sophia Cox.2  He married Hannah (?).3 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Hon. Emilia Sophia Cary, daughter of Lucius Ferdinand Cary, Master of Falkland and Anne Leith, on 24 August 1798.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died circa 1831.3
2 CONT
2 CONT He was Captain Nizam's , Paymaster Royal Scots Army 1823.3 He gained the rank of Major in the service of the Army.4
