2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of William Grant and Elizabeth Boone (sister of Daniel Boone, famous Kentucky explorer). She married Moses M. Mitchell on 27 Mar 1775. It is recorded that she passed away in Barren County, Kentucky, cemetery unknown. I is
2 CONC  also reported that they had the following children: Elizabeth Long Mitchell, John Mitchell, Samuel Mitchell, William Mitchell (1777 – 1857), Mary Grant Mitchell (1786 – 1852, Find A Grave Memorial# 32449458), Moses M. Mitchell (D
2 CONC ec. 8, 1790-Dec. 4, 1860, f.a.g. #20557726)
