1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir Alexander Gordon, Baronet [S 1625] of Lesmoir</strong>, cousin and heir, being son and heir of Alexander Gordon, Collector of Customs at Aberdeen, by Isabel, daughter of James Gordon, merchant of Holland, which Alexan
2 CONC der was 3rd son of the 5th Baronet. He succeeded to the Baronetcy 15 September 1750. He married, 5 April or 2 May 1759, Margaret, 1st daughter of Robert Scott of Duninald, co Forfar, by Anne, daughter of George Middleton, of Seato
2 CONC n, co Aberdeen. He died 25 March 1782."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524382#page/n319/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1900; Vol. II; page 300
