2 DATE 27 JUN 1758
2 PLAC Philorth Avenue
2 ADDR
3 CITY Fraserburgh
3 STAE Aberdeenshire
3 CTRY Scotland
1 BAPM
2 DATE 29 JUN 1758
2 ADDR
3 CITY Fraserburgh
3 STAE Aberdeenshire
3 CTRY Scotland
