1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/90022389/ann-logan
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann Seton Logan BIRTH	1763 England DEATH	15 Aug 1840 (aged 76–77) County Durham, England BURIAL	 Tynemouth General Cemetery North Shields, Metropolitan Borough of North Tyneside, Tyne and Wear, England  MEMORIAL ID	90022389 · View
2 CONC  Source
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann Seton Logan wife of Joseph Logan died the 15th of August 1840 and was buried on the 19th of August 1840. She was the daughter of Charles Seton and his wife Ann Dodds. K. Hancock and J. Peck research shows Ann and her father Ch
2 CONC arles descend from the Earls of Winton. Much thanks to Westoe in providing the dates of death and burial, and noted that Enoch Donkerley Thompson bought the burial plots for Ann and Joseph, when Joseph died of influenza. Ann and J
2 CONC oseph are buried in the now closed Tynemouth General Cemetery
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Members Parents Charles Seton 1711–1781
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann Dodds Seton
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse Joseph Logan 1762–1837
2 CONT
2 CONT Children Photo	 Mary Ann Logan Thompson 1796–1875
