1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JAMES MACDOWALL===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Macdowall is the son of William Macdowall of Garthland and Castle Semple, and his wife, Elizabeth 'Black Bess' Graham. He was born on 20 January 1752 [http://www.thepeerage.com/p45554.htm#i455536 Darryl Lundy's Peerage]''
2 CONC '
2 CONT
2 CONT ===First Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Macdowall married Isabel Peter. She was the daughter of Thomas Peter of Crossbasket and Cardarroch. The request for proclamation of marriage was booked at Glasgow in Lanarkshire, Scotland, in February 1770 [Glasgow Marria
2 CONC ges]. Darryl Lundy's Peerage reports that the marriage took place in 1769. [http://www.thepeerage.com/p45554.htm#i455536 Darryl Lundy's Peerage]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Second Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Macdowall married, secondly, Margaret Jamieson, daughter of Neil Jamieson, in 1782. He died on 30 May 1808 at age 56 at St. Lucia. He was a West India merchant at Glasgow, Lanarkshire, Scotland. He held the office of Bail
2 CONC lie of Glasgow in 1786. He held the office of Baillie of Glasgow in 1789. He held the office of Provost of Glasgow between 1790 and 1797. He was auditor of excise and import duties in Scotland between 1800 and 1808 [http://www.the
2 CONC peerage.com/p45554.htm#i455536 Darryl Lundy's Peerage]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children of the First Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT James Macdowall and Isabella Peter had five children:
2 CONT
2 CONT (1) Thomas Macdowall (2) James Milliken Macdowall d. 1792 (3) William Macdowall, 20th of Garthland b. 1770, d. 27 Apr 1840 (4) Day Hort Macdowall b. 1774, d. 1820 (5)  Alexander Peters Macdowall b. 1777, d. 1808
2 CONT
2 CONT # 
2 CONT # 
2 CONT # 
2 CONT # 
2 CONT # 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children of the Second Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT James Macdowall and Margaret Jamieson had ten children:
2 CONT
2 CONT (1) John Macdowall (2) Georgina Hay Macdowall (3) Neil Macdowall b. 1783 (4) Hay Macdowall b. 1785, d. 1798 (5) Elizabeth Macdowall b. 1 Mar 1786, d. 1857 (6) Margaret Feuilla Macdowall b. 1787 (7) Mary Ann Macdowall b. 1789, d. 1
2 CONC 828 (8) Lt.-Col. Lawrence Macdowall, 21st of Garthland b. 1791, d. 9 Sep 1842 (9) Isabella Graham Macdowall b. 1792, d. Aug 1864 (10) James Macdowall b. 1795
2 CONT
2 CONT # 
