2 CONT == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir Robert Menzies, Baronet [S. 1665], of Castle Menzies</strong> and Weem aforesaid, only s. and h., suc. to the Baronetcy on the death of his father. He m. Mary, 1st da. of James (Stewart), 2d Earl of Bute [S.], by Anne
2 CONC , da. of Archibald (Campbell), 1st Duke of Argyll [S.]. She d. 30 Dec. 1773, at Castle Menzies. He, who executed an entail of the Baronies of Menzies and Rannoch, d. s.p. 4 Sep. 1786."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524408#page/n267/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1904; Vol. IV; page 248
