2 CONT
2 CONT Occupation - Esquire.
2 CONT
2 CONT First Marriage - "Joseph Douglas to Celia Wright, 11 May 1807".  Dorchester Co., MD Marriage License Book 1, pg.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 1810 Census - Dorchester Co., MD - Joseph Doughlass:  1 male 0-10; 2 males 26-45; 1 female 0-10; 1 female 26-45.   
2 CONT
2 CONT Second Marriage - "Joseph Douglas to Charlotte Wilson, 26 Feb 1816". Dorchester Co., MD Marriage License Book 2, pg 26.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1820 Census - Caroline Co., MD - Joseph Douglass:  1 male 26-45; 3 females 0-10; 1 female 10-16; 1 female 26-45.    
2 CONT
2 CONT 1830 Census - Caroline Co., MD - Joseph Douglass:  1 male, 5-10; 1 male, 40-50; 2 females 0-5; 1 female, 30-40.
2 CONT
2 CONT Death - "Joseph Douglas, Esq., departed this life & left the world of sorrows in the 29th day of May in the year 1831."  Bible of Major Francis Turpin of Dorchester Co., MD.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with Celia Wright:  William W., 1808-1855; Amelia Adeline, 1809-1869; Celia, 1812-1822.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with Charlotte Wilson:  Margaret, 1817-1821; Louise, 1818-1824; James Elbert, 1820-1880; Thomas, 1822; Ann Crawford, 1825-1900; Mary Elizabeth, 1827-1870; Henry Clay, 1832-1885.
