2 CONT == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "(287) James Murray of Philiphaugh, born 1769; died 15th July 1854. He was served heir to his brother, John, 24th September 1836, and assumed the Baronetcy on the death of his kinsman (No. 303 below). He married, 1809, Mary, daugh
2 CONC ter of Henry Hughes, of Worcester, who died 1840, having had issue: -
2 CONT * John (No. 288 below).
2 CONT * James Murray.
2 CONT * Basil Hamilton Murray, died 1848."
2 CONT
