1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir Alexander Don, Baronet [S. 1667], of Newton Don</strong>, 2d but only surv. s. and h. ; suc. to the Baronetcy, 2 Oct. 1776; was sometime an officer in the army, and was, in 1778, Capt. of a reg. of Southern Fencibles.
2 CONC  He m. in 1778, Henrietta, sister and coheir [1796] of John (Cunningham), 15th Earl of Glencairn [S.], da. of William, the 13th Earl, by Elizabeth, da. and coheir of Hugh Macguire. She d. 12 March 1801. He d. 5 June 1815."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524408#page/n281/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1904; Vol. IV; page 263-264
