1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == LIEUTENANT JOHN CAMPBELL OF GLENSADDELL ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lieutenant John Campbell of Glensaddell is the son of Dugald Campbell of Glensaddell and his wife Lady Mary Lindsay. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=SC54%2f6%2f1%2f7%2f6&st=1&tc=y&t
2 CONC l=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Campbell+of+Glensaddell&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Inveraray Sheriff Court, Curatory and Tutory - edicts, claims and processes, reference SC54/6/1/7/6] His mother is the daughter of Joh
2 CONC n Lindsay, Earl of Crawford, and his wife Amelia Stewart. [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft#page/39/mode/1up Scots Peerage]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lieutenant John Campbell of Glensaddell married Joanna Bogle, daughter and co-heiress of John Bogle of Boggleshole, WS. [Lanarkshire Sasine Abridgements for 1811: Sasine Abridgement Number 8123, which cites Particular Register 
2 CONC 109/102]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children===
