2 CONC etails.aspx?reference=SC54%2f6%2f1%2f7%2f6&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Campbell+of+Glensaddell&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Inveraray Sheriff Court, Curatory and Tutory - edicts, claims and processes, ref
