2 CONT 26 June 1810: (7771) William Claud Campbell, Capt. 3d Reg. of Foot, as heir to Joanna Bogle, spouse of John Campbell of Saddell, his mother, Seised Jun. 23. 1810, - in the 33s. 4d. land of Nether Carmyle called Bogleshole, & other
2 CONC s; - insecurity of the fifth part of £1400, in Bond & Disp. By Colin Dunlop, Merchant, Glasgow, to Janet, Isobel, Marion, and the said Joanna & Margaret Bogle, daughters of John Bogle of Bogleshole, W.S., Jun. 4. 1759; - on Pr. Cl
2 CONC . Con. by John Sligo of Carmyle & his Curators, Jun. 12. 1810. P.R. 100. 153.
