1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT <strong>Hope, from 1792 Hope Johnstone, Earl of Hopetoun, James</strong>. 23/08/1741-29/05/1816. Ref: 758. Male.
2 CONT * Titles and British Honours: 3rd Earl of Hopetoun (1781), Baron (1809) Lord Lieutenant (1794-1816), Linlithgowshire.
2 CONT * Place of Birth: West Lothian.
2 CONT * Place of Death: Hopetoun House, West Lothian.
2 CONT * Profession: Landowner,Soldier.
2 CONT * Appointments Held: Ensign 1758-64 Germany; Representative Peer 1784-90, 1794-6.
2 CONT * Marital Status: Married (1766) Lady Elizabeth Carnegie d.1793.
2 CONT * Mother: Lady Anne Ogilvy d.1759.
2 CONT * Father: John Hope, 2nd Earl of Hopetoun FRS d.1781.
2 CONT * Siblings: Half-brother of John Hope, 4th Earl of Hopetoun FRSE 1766-1823.
2 CONT * Other Family: brother-in-law of Charles Hope (Lord Granton) FRSE 1763-1851, Henry Dundas (Viscount Melville), FRSE 1742-1811, Sir Patrick Murray of Ochtertyre FRSE 1771-1837.
2 CONT * Father-in-law of Archibald Cochrane, Earl of Dundonald FRSE 1749-1831.
2 CONT * References: DNB 27, 1891, 316; Anderson 2, 494-5; The Scots Peerage, 4, 1907, 500; Shapin 251.
2 CONT * Date of Election: 23/01/1786.
2 CONT * Proposers: John Walker, James Hutton, Henry Cullen (Physical Section Minute 07/11/1785 NLS Acc10,000/2).
2 CONT * Fellow Type: OF.
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: Waterston, Charles D; Macmillan Shearer, A (July 2006). [http://www.royalsoced.org.uk/cms/files/fellows/biographical_index/fells_indexp1.pdf Biographical index of former fellows of the Royal Society of Edinburgh, 1783-200
2 CONC 2]: Biographical Index. I. Edinburgh: The Royal Society of Edinburgh. ISBN 978-0-902198-84-5. page 453
2 CONT
