2 CONT
2 CONT The Story of the British Settlers of 1820 in South Africa by Harold Edward HOCKLY. Second Edition. Enlarged and revised. 1957.
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 210 - 211
2 CONT
2 CONT CAMPBELL, Charles (General); p. Gen. CAMPBELL's; s. Salisbury; w. Narre; f. Lawrence, John, Fredrick, William, Edward, Harriet, Catherine; r. Individual settler. The son John was Protector of Slaves at Graaff-Reinet and later Civi
2 CONC l Commissioner and Resident Magistrate at Cape Town. The son Frederick commanded a troop in the war against the Zulu chief Todo in 1844, and commanded a squadron against Moshesh in 1852.
2 CONT
