1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=11532612
2 CONT
2 CONT Asserts (without sources) he married on 19 Jul 1790 in Henry Co., VA, Francis Farriss (Ferris) b. 30 Jan 1771, d. 27 Jul 1831 in Dixon Springs, Smith Co., TN (buried at this cem.); they had the following children: 
2 CONT *Joseph A. b. 1792 in SC; 
2 CONT *Elizabeth Betsy b. 13 Aug 1793 who married Henry Brooks; 
2 CONT *George b. 8 Dec 1794 in SC; Sarah b. 1799 in Smith Co., TN m. John Hughes; 
2 CONT *Brice Ferriss Martin b. 1800 in Smith Co., TN m. Susannah T. Cayce; 
2 CONT *Jacob b. 1802 in Smith Co., TN; 
2 CONT *Norval D. b. 1811 in Smith Co., TN d. Jan 1837 in Dixon Springs, Smith Co., TN; 
2 CONT *William L. Jr. b. 1804 in Smith Co., TN, married Emily Allicorn and Sarha S. Greer; 
2 CONT *Thomas J. b. 1806 in Smith Co., TN, d. 18 Aug 1833 in Smith Co., TN; and 
2 CONT *Wilson Yandell b. 1810 in Smith Co., TN, who married Mary Ballard Bridgewater.
2 CONT
2 CONT Frances Farriss (Ferris) Martin BIRTH	30 Jan 1771 DEATH	27 Jul 1831 (aged 60) Dixon Springs, Smith County, Tennessee, USA BURIAL	 William Martin Cemetery Cato, Trousdale County, Tennessee, USA  MEMORIAL ID	11532692 · View Source
2 CONT
2 CONT MEMORIAL PHOTOS 1 FLOWERS 2 Frances Farris (Ferris) married on 19 Jul 1790 in Henry Co., VA, Col William L. Martin Sr. (buried at this cem.); *see his gravesite for their children.
2 CONT
