2 CONT
2 CONT Photo	 Elizabeth Betsy Martin Brooks 1794–1834
2 CONT
2 CONT Photo	 Brice Ferris Martin 1800–1843
2 CONT
2 CONT Photo	 Norval Douglas Martin 1811–1837
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription Wife of Col. William Martin Gravesite Details My grandfather, R.D. Brooks Jr., but a memorial to Col. and Mrs. Martin on our family plots in Dixon Springs Cemetery, but this is where they are actually buried.
2 CONT
