1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Please join this project on FTDNA - I'm kin Maternally and Paternally to both lineages of The Montgomery Clan- this may help us sort this out. [https://www.familytreedna.com/groups/your-scottish-ancestry/dna-result
2 CONC s] You will need full mtdna and BigYdna testing with FTNDA and Scottish Heritage. 
