1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir Thomas Burnett, Baronet [S 1626] of Crathes Castle</strong>, co Kincardine, cousin and heir male, being son and heir of William Burnett of Criggie, by Jean, daughter of Robert Burnett of Muchalls, which William (who d
2 CONC ied 1747, aged 64) was 2nd son of the 3rd Baronet. He succeeded to the Baronetcy in 1759. He married in or before 1755, Catherine, sister, whose issue became heir (11 February 1806) to Sir Alexander Ramsay, 6th Baronet [S 1626] of
2 CONC  Balmain, 4th daughter of Charles Ramsay, by Catherine, daughter of James Mill, Provost of Montrose. He died May 1783. Hie widow died 10 December 1798."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524382#page/n327/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1900; Vol. II; page 309
