2 CONT ==concerns==
2 CONT '''Date and place of birth have been reported to be the following.  It is unclear which (if any) are correct.  Further research is warranted:
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''February 2, 1779 in Hampshire County, Virginia (now West Virginia) <attested on his 2nd Find A Grave memorial>
2 CONT * '''February 2, 1780 in Alleghany County, Virginia <attested on his 1st Find A Grave memorial>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Date and place of death have been reported to be the following.  It is unclear which (if any) are correct.  Further research is warranted:
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''May 9, 1857 at Ellettsville, Monroe County, Indiana, United States <attested on his 2nd Find A Grave memorial>
2 CONT * '''May 9, 1858 at Ellettsville, Monroe County, Indiana, United States <attested on his 1st Find A Grave memorial>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Date and place of burial have been reported to be the following.  It is unclear which (if any) are correct.  Further research is warranted:
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''an unspecified date at Everman-Coffey Cemetery, Ellettsville, Monroe County, Indiana, United States <attested on his 1st Find A Grave memorial>
2 CONT * '''an unspecified date at Presbyterian Cemetery, 1319 West Temperance Street, Ellettsville, Monroe County, Indiana, United States <attested on his 2nd Find A Grave memorial>
2 CONT
