1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Mary Jane Skidmore''' was born in Randolph County, Virginia on February 14, 1789 and died in Randolph County after 1870. She was the daughter of Andrew Skidmore and Margaret Johnson. She married John I Chenoweth
2 CONC , son of John Chenoweth and Mary Pugh. Eight children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JOHN CHENOWETH and MARY SKIDMORE are:
2 CONT * Lemuel b. June 25, 1811, Beverly, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d. August 26, 1887, Beverly, Randolph Co., WV; m. NANCY ANN HART, June 22, 1836, Beverly, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); b. November 22, 1821, Beverly, Randolph Co., VA (n
2 CONC ow WV); d. May 18, 1912, Beverly, Randolph Co., WV.
2 CONT * George Washington b. 1813, Beverly, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d. December 18, 1883, Elkins, Randolph Co., WV; m. (1) RACHEL WEES, November 11, 1835, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); b. 1817, Virginia; d. Bef. 1867; m. (2) SARAH WEESE
2 CONC , October 20, 1866, Randolph Co., WV; b. 1830, Virginia.
2 CONT * Archibald b. 1817, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d. 1893, Randolph Co., WV; m. MARGARET M. HYRE, Bef. 1844; b. 1825, Virginia; d. 1897, Beverly, Randolph Co., WV.
2 CONT * Elijah H. b. July 30, 1819, Beverly, Randolph Co., VA; d. May 09, 1900, Beverly, Randolph Co., WV; m. NANCY CATHERINE WARD, December 18, 1845, Elkins, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); b. June 19, 1827, Virginia; d. May 05, 1921, Rando
2 CONC lph Co., WV.
2 CONT * Jerusha b. January 31, 1821, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d. July 30, 1891, Randolph Co., WV; m. ALLISON DANIELS, October 10, 1838, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); b. April 05, 1811, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d. July 12, 1893, Randolp
2 CONC h Co., WV.
2 CONT * Eli b. 1827, Beverly, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d. June 10, 1895, Layfette Co., MO; m. (1) REBECCA BROWN, January 02, 1854, Marion Co., VA (now WV); b. Abt. 1838, Marion Co., VA (now WV); d. Bef. 1880; m. (2) JANE MARTIN, Janua
2 CONC ry 10, 1884, Ritchie Co., WV; b. Abt. 1847.
2 CONT * Martha E. b. February 27, 1828, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d. May 03, 1911, West Virginia; m. JOB WEBLTON 'WEBLEY' DANIELS, December 11, 1851, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); b. July 06, 1830, Randolph Co., VA (now WV); d. April 15, 
