2 CONT Mary Erskine was the daughter of Reverend John Erskine and Hon. Christian Mackay.1 She married Charles Stuart, son of James Stuart and Elizabeth Drummond, on 29 October 1773.1 She died on 15 April 1817.1
2 CONT
2 CONT From 29 October 1773, her married name became Stuart.1
