1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Laurence Oliphant of Condie and Newton, Perthshire, descended from Laurence Oliphant, first of Condie, grandson of William Oliphant of Newton, by his wife, the heiress of Berriedale, succeeded to the estate in 1806
2 CONC . The eldest son of Ebenezer Oliphant of Condie and Newton, by Mary, 3d daughter of Sir William Stirling, baronet, of Ardoch, he was born in 1791, and has been thrice married. His son and heir, by his 3d wife, Marianne, eldest dau
2 CONC ghter of Stuart Oliphant, Esq. of Rossie, named Laurence-James, was born in 1846. The estate of Condie was purchased by this family in 1601.
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.electricscotland.com/history/nation/oliphant.htm Referenced from Electric Scotland]
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Stirling, daughter of Sir William Stirling of Ardoch, 4th Baronet.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Husband: Ebenezer Oliphant who was the son of Laurence Oliphant, 6th of Condie and Margaret Murray . 
2 CONT * Marriage: 1790 
2 CONT * Death:1807 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Ebenezer Oliphant and Mary Stirling (some refer to them having 11 children)
2 CONT
2 CONT * Laurence Oliphant, 8th of Condie b. 22 Jun 1791, d. 29 May 1862 [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laurence_Oliphant_(Scottish_politician%29 MP]
2 CONT * William Oliphant  b. 1792, d. 1828
2 CONT * Sir Anthony Oliphant b. 17 Nov 1793, d. 1859
2 CONT * Christian Oliphant  b. 13 Apr 1795, d. 31 May 1809
2 CONT * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/James_Oliphant Lt.-Col. James Oliphant]  b. 23 Aug 1796, d. 1881
2 CONT * Thomas Oliphant  b. 1799, d. 1872
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT * Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 2, page 2997. 
2 CONT * Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT * Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition, volume 2, page 2998.
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.thepeerage.com/p34932.htm#i349318 The Peerage]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married Ebenezer OLIPHANT, son of Laurence OLIPHANT 6th of Condie and Margaret MURRAY, on 10 Jun 1790 in Ardoch. Ebenezer died 1807.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 72	M	i	Laurence OLIPHANT 8th of Condie was christened 22 Jun 1791 in Forgandenny, Perth. He died 29 May 1862.
2 CONT
2 CONT 73	M	ii	William OLIPHANT was christened 9 Aug 1792 in Forgandenny, Perth. He died 1828.
2 CONT
2 CONT 74	M	iii	Anthony OLIPHANT was born 17 Nov 1793 and was christened 25 Nov 1793 in Forgandenny, Perth. He died 1859.
2 CONT
2 CONT 75	F	iv	Christian OLIPHANT was born 15 Apr 1795 in Forgandenny, Perth. She died 31 May 1809.
2 CONT
2 CONT 76	M	v	James OLIPHANT was born 23 Aug 1796 in Forgandenny, Perth. He died 1881.
2 CONT
2 CONT 77	M	vi	Thomas OLIPHANT was born 25 Dec 1799 in Forgandenny, Perth. He died 1872.
