2 CONT ** The Burying Ground of the Right Hon. Lord Macleod.
2 CONT ** Sacred to the memory of the Right Hon. Isabel Gordon,
2 CONT ** relict of George, 3rd Earl of Cromarty,
2 CONT ** and daughter of Sir John Gordon
2 CONT ** died Sunday, 23 April 1769 Aged 64.
2 CONT ** The Right Hon. John Lord Macleod,
2 CONT ** Major General in the British Service,
2 CONT ** and Colonel of the 71st Regiment of Foot;
2 CONT ** Count Cromarty, and commandant of the Order of the Sword in the Kingdom of Sweden.
2 CONT ** Eldest son of the said George, Earl of Cromarty.
2 CONT ** Died Thursday, 2 April 1789 Aged 63.
2 CONT ** The Right Hon. Lady, Jane Mackenzie,
2 CONT ** last surviving daughter of the said George, Earl of Cromarty,
2 CONT ** died unmarried Wednesday, 21 October 1812 Aged 74.
2 CONT ** Isabella Murray, eldest daughter of Sir William Murray of Ochtertyre, Baronet
2 CONT ** by Lady Augusta, youngest daughter of the said Earl of Cromarty,
2 CONT ** and wife of James Glassford, Esquire, advocate, died Tuesday, 4 July 1809 aged 34.
