1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Stewart-2770 WikiTree Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jan 7 2022, 21:51:21 UTC''
