1 CONT
1 CONT Reign: 1715-74; His failure to provide strong leadership and badly needed
1 CONT reformscontributed to the crisis that brought on the Franch Revolution. He was
1 CONT frequently influenced by his mistresses, the most powerful of whom was the
1 CONT marquise de Pompadour.  Louis XV's reported prophecy, "After me, the deluge,"
1 CONT was fulfilled in the overthrow of the French monarch less than two decades
1 CONT later.
0 @N6000000002322350172@ NOTE Succeeded his G-grandfather Louis XIV, and he in turn was succeeded by his
